00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:16.240
So we want to take that grunt
work out of the system for you

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:18.147
and we want to do it for you.

00:04:18.147 --> 00:04:19.980
And that's where we'll
go with this as well.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.313
We'll show you how that's done.

00:04:23.313 --> 00:04:24.980
And ultimately, we
want to take all this

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.450
towards a consistent experience.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:28.530
That's what really
we're doing here.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.245
We want to build this
consistent system,

00:04:30.245 --> 00:04:32.120
so that you only have
to build your tech once

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.860
and then you can
deploy it anywhere.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.160
That's really important to us.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.743
And automation is a
huge part of that.

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:38.285
Because it'll help
you be consistent.

00:04:38.285 --> 00:04:39.868
Because obviously,
you don't have time

00:04:39.868 --> 00:04:42.020
