new tech as it comes out.

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:43.840
You have other
things to do as well.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.340
So we want to make sure that
you get a consistent experience

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.060
using Anthos.

